Recruit_Luis:
UNIT Luis 0x0 0x1 Level(4,NPC,0) [3,8] 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 [ThornWhip] NoAI
UNIT

//DH
Luis_RecruitEvent:
GuildRecruit(Luis,Guild_Test_Dialogue,0x20)
EndEvent

GuildhallLoadDarkHunters:
FADI 10; CLEN 0; LOAD1 0x0 BehindCounterGerson; LOAD1 0x0 GuildmasterCalledIn
GuildLoadFlagReset
GuildLoad(Luis,Recruit_Luis,0x1)
FADU 10
ENDA

